      "label": "User projected onto the textual material expressing Booth's alleged delusion",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the bottom text ('yall sure abraham lincoln dead? he aint up here') which directly addresses the viewer ('yall') and presents a scenario attributed to John Wilkes Booth. This creates an interaction where the user is positioned as the one being addressed or implicated in the meme's satirical claim about Booth's delusion.",
